  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LUMUST Project phase out workplan 2010-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mbarara University of Science and Technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LUMUST utfasningsprojekt. Syfter &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kra en stabil uth&#xe5;llighet vad g&#xe4;ller den institutionella b&#xe4;rkraftigheten hos Mbarara universitetet att medverka till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad h&#xe4;lsa hos befolkningen i v&#xe4;stra Uganda. Medel ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r forskningsutbyte, MPH-programmet, l&#xe4;romedelsutveckling etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LUMUST phase out objective is to ensure overall sustainability of the institutional capacity of Mbarara University in regard to its role to contribute to the health status of the population in western Uganda. Funds will support research collaboration, MPH program,curriculum development, capacity development, peer project and HIV/AIDS policy with their integration within Mbarara university</narrative>
  </description>
